          "wordIds": [
            "semester"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Emily 和 Brian 一起檢視下學期開設的每一門選修課。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Unsure about his academic plan, Brian sighs and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Which ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "which-course-should-i-choose"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "course",
          "phraseIds": [
            "which-course-should-i-choose"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "course"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " should I ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "which-course-should-i-choose"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "choose",
          "phraseIds": [
            "which-course-should-i-choose"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "choose"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "which-course-should-i-choose"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Brian 對自己的學業規劃拿不定主意，嘆了口氣問道：「我該選哪門課呢？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Emily compares an advanced physics class with a world literature seminar to check how much academic "
        },
        {
          "text": "credit",
          "wordIds": [
            "credit"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " each offers."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Emily 將進階物理課與世界文學專題進行比較，確認各能獲得多少學術學分。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Brian points to the artificial intelligence syllabus, explaining his deep "
        },
        {
          "text": "interest",
          "wordIds": [
            "interest"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " in data science: “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'm interested in this ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "im-interested-in-this-course"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "course",
          "phraseIds": [
            "im-interested-in-this-course"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "course"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "im-interested-in-this-course"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Brian 指著人工智慧的課程大綱，說明自己對資料科學的濃厚興趣：「我對這門課很感興趣。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Emily smiles and cautions him about the heavy lab workload, adding, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "That sounds challenging.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "that-sounds-challenging"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Emily 微笑著提醒他實驗室的繁重負擔，並補充說：「聽起來很有挑戰性。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "After checking his weekly timetable to avoid time conflicts, Brian says happily, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "It fits my schedule.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "it-fits-my-schedule"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在檢查每週課表確認沒有衝堂之後，Brian 開心地說：「這符合我的時間安排。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He clicks the registration button with confidence, eager to learn new skills."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他滿懷信心地按下選課登記按鈕，熱切期盼著學習新技能。"
    }
  ],
